<style>.tktx-page-section{--paper:#ffffff;--ink:#000000;--gutter:2.45vw;--content-max:1400px;--ease:cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}.tktx-page-section *{box-sizing:border-box}.tktx-page-section a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:760px){.tktx-page-section{--gutter:6vw}}</style>
{{ 'home-sections.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<div class="tktx-store tktx-page-section">
{% capture tktx_image %}<figure class="story-image{% if section.settings.layout == 'image-left' %} authentic-image{% endif %}">{% if section.settings.image != blank %}{{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 1600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '600,900,1200,1600', sizes: '(max-width: 900px) 88vw, 650px' }}{% else %}{% if section.settings.layout == 'image-left' %}<img src="{{ 'tktx-authentic-model.png' | asset_url }}" width="1400" height="870" alt="Close-up of a tattoo artist working with a tattoo machine" loading="lazy">{% else %}<img src="{{ 'tktx-story-model.png' | asset_url }}" width="750" height="750" alt="Black and white portrait of a tattooed model" loading="lazy">{% endif %}{% endif %}<figcaption>{{ section.settings.caption | escape }}</figcaption></figure>{% endcapture %}
<section class="{% if section.settings.layout == 'image-left' %}authentic-section{% else %}story-section{% endif %}" aria-labelledby="story-title-{{ section.id }}">
<div class="page-container story-grid">
{% if section.settings.layout == 'image-left' %}{{ tktx_image }}{% endif %}
<div class="story-copy"><p class="section-kicker">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p><h2 id="story-title-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.heading | escape | newline_to_br }}</h2><div class="story-text">{{ section.settings.body }}</div><a class="dark-button" href="{{ section.settings.link | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Shop now <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
{% if section.settings.layout == 'image-right' %}{{ tktx_image }}{% endif %}
</div></section>
</div>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "TKTX image with text",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout",
      "label": "Image side",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "image-right",
          "label": "Right"
        },
        {
          "value": "image-left",
          "label": "Left"
        }
      ],
      "default": "image-right"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Small introduction",
      "default": "02 / THE ORIGINAL TKTX"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "NUMBING CREAM\nOF TKTX."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Content",
      "default": "<p>A tattoo is considered a fashion statement and people of all ages from teen to old age more often take a tattoo. Most people know that putting a tattoo can be a painful procedure and that’s why numbing creams like TKTX have been invented. The needles of the tattoo artist press into your skin and a work of art is created for life. Even though the tattoo artists believe that pain is a part of tattooing, they are open to TKTX numbing creams.</p>\n            <p>TKTX is an anesthetic ointment that can be applied to the skin to suppress the pain of tattooing. TKTX is a numbing cream that is used all over the world and that works effectively against pain. People who have a low pain threshold are in this way sooner persuaded to have a tattoo.</p>\n            <p>For other applications such as permanent make-up, tattoo removal with laser, hair removal with laser, waxing, lipfillers and microblading, TKTX can be used.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image",
      "label": "Image"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "caption",
      "label": "Image caption",
      "default": "TKTX / THE ORIGINAL COLLECTION"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "link",
      "label": "Shop link"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "TKTX product story"
    },
    {
      "name": "TKTX authenticity",
      "settings": {
        "layout": "image-left",
        "eyebrow": "04 / KNOW YOUR ORIGINAL",
        "heading": "ORIGINAL TKTX.\nONLY ON TKTX.CO.",
        "body": "<p>We are the sole distributor of TKTX and sell only original creams. Do not take risks with cheaper versions of Ebay, AliExpress, Wish or other websites — these can cause serious burns and numb maximum 30 minutes. You can find more information under our ‘most frequently asked questions’ section.</p><p>We ONLY sell on www.tktx.co and our socials handle is @tktx.europe.</p>",
        "caption": "ORIGINAL TKTX / WWW.TKTX.CO"
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
